{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-34-1","title":"Psalms 34:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David praises God, and exhorts others thereto by his experience. 8 They are blessed that trust in God. 11 He exhorts to the fear of God. 15 The privileges of the righteous.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2942. B.C. 1062. (Title.) Abimelech. or, Achish.This is the second of the alphabetical Psalms (the first being Ps 25:); each verse beginning consecutively with a letter of the Hebrew alphabet. The verse, however, which begins with [\\^w\\^, v�v,] {wav,} and which should come in between the fifth and sixth, is totally wanting; but as the 22nd, which now begins with [\\^p\\^, p�,] {pay, podeh,} \"redeemeth,\" is entirely out of the series, it is not improbable that it was originally written {oophodeh,} \"and redeemeth\" and occupied that situation, in which connection it reads admirably.</p>\n<p>Ge 20:2; 26:1; 1Sa 21:13-15; Pr 29:25 See on Ps. 71:8,14,15; 145:1,2; Isa 24:15,16; Ac 5:41; 16:25; Eph 5:20 Col 3:17; 1Th 5:18; 2Th 1:3; 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-2","title":"Psalms 34:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>make. 44:8; 105:3; Isa 45:25; Jer 9:24; 1Co 1:31; 2Co 10:17 the humble. 22:22-24; 32:5,6; 119:74; 142:7; 1Ti 1:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-3","title":"Psalms 34:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>magnify. 35:27; 40:16; 69:30; Lu 1:46; Ac 19:17; Php 1:20 let us. 33:1,2; 66:8; 103:20-22; 148:1-14; 1Ch 29:20; 2Ch 29:30; Re 14:7 Re 19:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-4","title":"Psalms 34:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>sought. 18:6; 22:24; 31:22; 77:1,2; 116:1-6; Jon 2:2; Mt 7:7; Lu 11:9 2Co 12:8,9; Heb 5:7 from. 27:1,2; 46:2; 56:3; 1Sa 27:1; Isa 12:2; 2Co 7:5,6; 2Ti 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-5","title":"Psalms 34:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>They. 123:1,2; Isa 45:22; Heb 12:2 and were. 13:3; 18:28; 97:11; Es 8:16 lightened. or, flowed unto him. their. 83:16; 2Sa 19:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-6","title":"Psalms 34:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>This. 3:4; 10:17; 40:17; 66:16-20 saved. 17-19; Ge 48:16; 2Sa 22:1; Re 7:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-7","title":"Psalms 34:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>The angel. 91:11; 2Ki 6:17; 19:35; Da 6:22; Mt 18:10; Lu 16:22; Heb 1:14 encampeth. Ge 32:1,2; Zec 9:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-8","title":"Psalms 34:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>taste. 63:5; 119:103; So 2:3; 5:1; Heb 6:4,5; 1Pe 2:2,3; 1Jo 1:1-3 Lord. 36:7,10; 52:1; Jer 31:14; Zec 9:17; 1Jo 4:7-10 blessed. 2:12; 84:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-9","title":"Psalms 34:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>fear. 22:23; 31:23; 89:7; Ge 22:12; Isa 8:13,14; Ho 3:5; Re 15:3,4 for. 23:1; Lu 12:30-32; Ro 8:32; 1Co 3:22,23; Php 4:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-10","title":"Psalms 34:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>lions. 104:21; Job 4:10,11; Lu 1:51-53 but. 84:11; Mt 6:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-11","title":"Psalms 34:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Come. Pr 4:1; 7:24; 8:17,32; 22:6; Ec 11:9,10; 12:1; Isa 28:9; Mt 18:2-4 Mr 10:14-16; Joh 13:33; 2Ti 3:15 I will. 32:8; 111:10; Pr 1:7; 2:1-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-12","title":"Psalms 34:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>What. 21:4; 91:16; De 6:2; 30:20; 1Pe 3:10,11 that he. 4:6; Job 7:7; Ec 2:3; 12:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-13","title":"Psalms 34:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Keep. 39:1; Pr 18:21; Mt 12:35-37; Jas 1:19,26; 3:2,5-10 speaking. 55:11; Pr 12:7,19,22; 19:9; Isa 63:8; Col 3:9; 1Pe 2:1,22 Re 14:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-14","title":"Psalms 34:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Depart. 37:27; Job 28:28; Pr 3:7; 8:13; 13:14; 16:16,17; Isa 1:16,17 Ro 12:9; 2Ti 2:19; 1Pe 3:11 do. Ac 10:38; Ga 6:10; Tit 2:14; Heb 13:16; 3Jo 1:11 seek. 120:7; Mt 5:9; Ro 12:18; 14:17; 2Co 13:11; 1Th 4:11; Heb 12:14 Jas 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-15","title":"Psalms 34:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>The. 33:18; Job 36:7; 1Pe 3:12 and. 6,17; 130:2; 2Ch 6:40; Isa 37:14-21; Da 9:17-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-16","title":"Psalms 34:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>face. Le 17:10; 26:17; Jer 44:11; Eze 14:7,8; Am 9:4 to cut. 10:16; Job 18:17; Pr 10:7; Ec 8:10; Jer 17:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-17","title":"Psalms 34:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>The righteous.There is no word for the righteous in the present Hebrew text; but it is preserved in all the versions; and it was probably lost from its similitude to {tz��koo,} \"they cry:\"--{tz��koo tazddeekim,} \"the righteous cry.\"</p>\n<p>cry. 6,15,19; 91:15; 145:18-20; 2Ch 32:20,21,24; Isa 65:24; Ac 12:5-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-18","title":"Psalms 34:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>is nigh. 75:1; 85:9; 119:151; 145:18; Isa 55:6 unto them, etc. Heb. to the broken of heart. 51:17; 147:3; Isa 61:1; Lu 4:18 such as, etc. Heb. the contrite of spirit. 2Ki 22:19; Isa 57:15; 66:2; Eze 36:26,31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-19","title":"Psalms 34:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Many. 71:20; Job 5:19; 30:9-31; 42:12; Pr 24:16; Joh 16:33; Ac 14:22 2Co 4:7-12,17; 11:23-27; 1Th 3:3,4; 2Ti 3:11,12; Heb 11:33-38 Jas 5:10,11; 1Pe 4:12,13; Re 7:14-17 but. 6,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-20","title":"Psalms 34:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>35:10; 91:12; Da 6:22-24; Joh 19:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-21","title":"Psalms 34:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Evil. 37:30-40; 94:23; Isa 3:11 they. 37:12-15; 40:15; 89:23; 1Sa 19:4,5; 31:4; 1Ki 22:8,37; Lu 19:14,27 Lu 19:41-44; Joh 7:7; 15:18-23; 1Th 2:15,16; 2Th 1:6,9 desolate. or, guilty. Ex 20:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-34-22","title":"Psalms 34:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":34,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":34,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>redeemeth. 31:5; 71:23; 103:4; 130:8; Ge 48:16; 2Sa 4:9; 1Ki 1:29; La 3:58 1Pe 1:18,19; Re 5:9 none. 9:9,10; 84:11,12; Joh 10:27-29; Ro 8:31-39; 1Pe 1:5</p>"}]}